ll,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiT4tXGy9KWAxWdnq8BHfegERIQ3YcHCOUBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiT4tXGy9KWAxWdnq8BHfegERIQ3IcHCOQBKBw",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["被店外菜單上的牛肉吸引，看到粉嫩又大塊的牛肉就完全無法擋，點了一個極盛厚切牛排+C套餐（溫泉蛋+旬野時蔬），牛肉是蠻厚的，很有咬勁不軟嫩，有的會帶一點筋不好咬，原本附的溫泉蛋有點溫涼，套餐的溫泉蛋整個是冰的，由於飯裡的醬料不多且清淡，拌進溫泉蛋後真的沒什麽鹹味，洋蔥又很生辣，整個吃起來的味道跟口感個人都不愛，時蔬是川燙高麗菜，調味也是很清淡，沒有沾到醬的部份就沒味道，店內雞湯是可自助無限續碗的，雞湯上浮一層雞油，但喝起來味道清淡不會很油膩。\n真的可惜了門口看起來很美味的菜單，牛肉還是有當面問店家後選擇了較嫩的。",null,[0,258]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7600290513937160301/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZibVpYWTBSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7600290513937160301/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZibVpYWTBSQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7600290513937160301/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZibVpYWTBSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7600290513937160301/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZibVpYWTBSQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7600290513937160301/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZibVpYWTBSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7600290513937160301/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZibVpYWTBSQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,6748,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvbmZXY0RBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x9fa6b1a04ce8953f!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMConfWcDA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvbmZXY0RBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvbmZXY0RBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNQ29uZldjakFFEhNDZ3dJcUpTTndBWVFvSnFBdlFNGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNQ29uZldjVEESE0Nnd0lfWktOd0FZUTJOVHV6QU0iEgkAAAAAAAAAA